  await this.prisma.inventoryCheckIssue.update({
    where: { id: createdIssue.id },
    data: {
      context: {
        ...existingContext,
        matchSuggestions: suggestions,
      },
    },
  });
}
```

**Suggestion Sources:**
- Barrels at nearby locations (adjacent racks)
- Barrels matching characteristics (size, cooperage, customer)
- Barrels in the same job's unscanned locations

