1. User submits query → ClaudeAgentController receives POST to `/agent/chat`
2. Service converts MCP tools to Claude tool format
3. Claude processes query with access to warehouse tools (run_query, rag_query, vector_search, etc.)
4. If Claude calls tools → Service executes via McpService → Results appended to conversation
5. Loop continues until Claude returns `end_turn` or max iterations exceeded
